<title>JAPAN: Japan 10-yr JGB auction lowest price of 100.80.</title>
<headline>Japan 10-yr JGB auction lowest price of 100.80.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the 2.7 percent 196th 10-year Japanese government bond (JGB) auction, covering 60 percent of the one trillion yen issue, were as follows, the Ministry of Finance said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> Lowest price	 100.80   Stop rate     2.599 pct</p>
<p> Average price	100.84   Average yield 2.594 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   2.5313 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted bids	591.09 billion yen</p>
<p> Bids accepted at lowest price 43.7615 pct</p>
<p> Issue date   June 20, 1997   Maturity   June 20, 2007</p>
</text>
